    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I got some shots from Tuesday, but I'm going into all the details. But as far as the people I dealt with, I had a actually pretty good working relationship with Democrats. I like to think it's because they knew where I was coming from. And if I gave my word, I was going to work with them on a project, they would. I wouldn't, you know, run away when it got tough. And also I wouldn't take cheap shots at them. I've tried always to avoid getting involved in know, personal issues. And again, everyone can have some skill somewhere in the family. I like to think I don't. But again, you know, certainly people can make those allegations against you. And so I never, I've never really done that to anyone else. I think it's, you know, you're running against one person, not against members of his family or his friends. You're running against him and you take it from there.",
