  {
    "episode_id": 51684,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51684.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 45,
    "turn_text": "Why does Democrats, if you're pro-America, right, you're pro for this country, they automatically say white supremacy. Well, I don't understand their logic behind that. If you're for your country that you live in and you pay taxes for, why are you all white supremacists, quote unquote, when that's not even close to what that means?",
